{"task_id": "Mbpp/63", "solution": "from typing import List, Tuple, Union\n\ndef max_difference(tuple_list: List[Tuple[Union[int, float], Union[int, float]]]) -> Union[int, float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum absolute difference between elements in available pairs.\n    Returns 0 if the input list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not tuple_list:\n        return 0\n\n    max_diff = 0\n    for pair in tuple_list:\n        element1, element2 = pair\n        current_diff = abs(element1 - element2)\n        if current_diff > max_diff:\n            max_diff = current_diff\n            \n    return max_diff"}
