{"task_id": "Mbpp/65", "solution": "def recursive_list_sum(input_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Flattens a list and sums all numerical elements within it.\n    This function uses a helper generator to recursively flatten the input.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _flatten_list(nested_list):\n        \"\"\"\n        Recursively yields numerical elements from a nested list.\n        Non-list, non-numeric elements are ignored.\n        \"\"\"\n        for item in nested_list:\n            if isinstance(item, list):\n                yield from _flatten_list(item)\n            elif isinstance(item, (int, float)):\n                yield item\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for num in _flatten_list(input_list):\n        total_sum += num\n    return total_sum"}
